Z||000001||Bob Englert||11-16-2000||03:10 PM||||While I don't know if any mechanics in the Charoltte area, I would strongly suggest that you talk to Ed Parks at the Fiero Factory in Huntsville, AL.  Ed is well known in the Fiero community, is to a fault, and stands behind his work.  I only works on Fieros.  I have had almost all major work that I could not do myself done by Ed and his folks (Dave and Jerremy).<P>I will be taking one of my 87 GT's to Ed to have a new clutch installed and other work done in the next 4-6 weeks.  I will be leaving the car for a while and let them work on it as time permits.<P>Ed can be reached at 256-420-5391.  His web site is <A HREF="http://www.welcome.to/thefierofactory" TARGET=_blank>http://www.welcome.to/thefierofactory</A> <BR>and his email is fierofactory@juno.com.<P><BR>  <BR><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>87 Coupe<BR>85 SE (For Sale)||||reg||1
